        <span class="absolute -top-4 right-6 rotate-3 rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-wine bg-rose px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-wine shadow-[2px_2px_0_var(--color-wine)]">Vagas limitadas.</span>
